This project is FAiND — an AI-powered lost and found platform for university campuses.

Always read and follow FAIND_BRAIN_V4.1.md as the single source of truth.

Rules:
- Stack is fixed: React + Vite + Tailwind + FastAPI + PostgreSQL + SQLAlchemy
- All DB access via SQLAlchemy ORM — no raw SQL ever
- All routes protected with JWT — verify on backend always
- IDOR prevention on every resource endpoint
- Sensitive fields (hidden answers, tip amounts) always AES-256-GCM encrypted
- Never expose admin-only fields in public API responses
- Business logic in services, not route handlers
- Do not introduce technologies outside the defined stack
- Do not rewrite working systems unless instructed
- Build one feature at a time, modularly
- rate limiting via slowapi only
